Source: rootapp
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://www.rootapp.com

Package: rootapp
Architecture: amd64
# Runtime set: the AppImage payload's ELF DT_NEEDED union (readelf over
# every shipped ELF), including the shipped Chromium helper's cups/dbus/
# udev needs, the global-hotkey lib's Xinerama need, and SkiaSharp's
# fontconfig need. t64 names target Debian Testing.
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, hicolor-icon-theme, libasound2t64, libatk1.0-0t64, libatk-bridge2.0-0t64, libatspi2.0-0, libcups2t64, libdbus-1-3, libegl1, libfontconfig1, libgbm1, libgtk-3-0t64, libnotify4, libpulse0, libudev1, libvulkan1, libwayland-client0, libwayland-cursor0, libwayland-egl1, libx11-6, libxcb1, libxcomposite1, libxcursor1, libxdamage1, libxinerama1, libxkbcommon0, libxrandr2, libxrender1, libxss1, libxt6, libxtst6, libnspr4, libnss3, wl-clipboard, xdg-utils
Description: Discord alternative for gaming communities and large groups
 Root App is a new Discord alternative, designed for gaming communities
 and large online groups.
